    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p><strong>Learn more about Perpetual Harvest products…</strong><em>Flower, Pre-Rolls, Infused Pre-Rolls, Edibles, Concentrate and more.</em></p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "Fresh ∞ Potent ∞ Affordable, PERPETUAL."
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Discover PERPETUAL, the cannabis brand for everyone, dedicated to offering fresh, potent products at affordable prices. Our perpetual cultivation guarantees a consistent experience every time. From the canna-curious to the canna-suers, PERPETUAL provides reliable, approachable quality for all.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "Flower & Ready-To-Roll"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>One Strain per bag. Great genetics in an approachable package.</p><p>This perpetually grown cannabis is harvested daily to ensure the freshest product at an affordable price that doesn’t compromise quality.</p><p>Experience the consistency that <strong>PERPETUAL</strong> can guarantee. <strong>Fresh ∞ Potent ∞ Affordable. </strong></p>",
     "overflow": true
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "Pre-rolls & Concentrates"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Single strain of great genetics from a single source. Our perpetual harvest provides fresh material for exceptionally terpy Pre-rolls and concentrates.</p><p>Dive into the essence of <strong>PERPETUAL</strong>: <strong>Fresh ∞ Potent ∞ Affordable</strong>.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p><a href=\"/brands/perpetual-harvest/\" data-link=\"dead\"><strong>Click here to shop Perpetual Harvest products!</strong></a></p>"
    },
